{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01076",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.61,
      "end_seconds": 4.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Hi doctor, um, am I too early?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.54,
      "end_seconds": 9.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 10.12,
      "end_seconds": 16.54,
      "duration_seconds": 6.42,
      "text": "Morning, uh, doctor. I'll stay and fill in anything that's missed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.38,
      "end_seconds": 22.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. We'll go through it together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.69,
      "end_seconds": 36.05,
      "duration_seconds": 12.36,
      "text": "Um, so... pain around my period. That's why I came. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.04,
      "end_seconds": 39.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.49,
      "end_seconds": 55.54,
      "duration_seconds": 14.05,
      "text": "Uh, it's sumatriptan, 50 milligrams, when needed for my migraines. So, it's clopidogrel, 75 milligrams, once a day for the stent. Mefenamic acid, 500 milligrams, when it hurts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.3,
      "end_seconds": 66.98,
      "duration_seconds": 9.68,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.8,
      "end_seconds": 81.58,
      "duration_seconds": 10.78,
      "text": "It sort of comes and goes. I get some relief from painkillers. A six out of ten, um, I suppose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.23,
      "end_seconds": 85.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.54,
      "end_seconds": 107.9,
      "duration_seconds": 21.36,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get pain low in the pelvis as well. The pain low in the pelvis? That's been for two weeks. Erm, you know, I had a lot of tiredness before. That's settled now, though."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.97,
      "end_seconds": 113.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Have you noticed vaginal discharge, fever or vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.49,
      "end_seconds": 119.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "No, um, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.35,
      "end_seconds": 127.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Have you had any burning when passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.25,
      "end_seconds": 136.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "So, no, none, no burning when passing urine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 137.6,
      "end_seconds": 144.52,
      "duration_seconds": 6.92,
      "text": "Actually, doctor, I did notice burning when passing urine. She doesn't always say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.69,
      "end_seconds": 153.76,
      "duration_seconds": 6.07,
      "text": "No, I don't think I did. Maybe a little, I'm not sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.06,
      "end_seconds": 163.46,
      "duration_seconds": 8.4,
      "text": "Alright, I'll note both what you've said and what you've noticed. Right, your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.34,
      "end_seconds": 165.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.08,
      "text": "Breathing's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.65,
      "end_seconds": 169.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "How are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.66,
      "end_seconds": 172.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "I move fine otherwise."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.14,
      "end_seconds": 181.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.57,
      "end_seconds": 187.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 188.8,
      "end_seconds": 197.59,
      "duration_seconds": 8.79,
      "text": "Hold on, you know, doctor, I think she reacted to amoxicillin once. I'm not certain, though."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.19,
      "end_seconds": 202.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Maybe, but I don't recall it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.82,
      "end_seconds": 211.44,
      "duration_seconds": 7.62,
      "text": "Alright, so that's unclear. I'll record what each of you said. Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.78,
      "end_seconds": 220.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "Ah, I have migraines, for five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.42,
      "end_seconds": 223.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "Any other things?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.55,
      "end_seconds": 232.69,
      "duration_seconds": 8.14,
      "text": "I've had an underactive thyroid for nearly five years now. I've had heart disease, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.84,
      "end_seconds": 240.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Is there anything more?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.13,
      "end_seconds": 248.94,
      "duration_seconds": 6.81,
      "text": "Yes, migraines is known to us, good to have that clear. And your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 249.76,
      "end_seconds": 252.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.02,
      "end_seconds": 260.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Alright, tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.32,
      "end_seconds": 266.68,
      "duration_seconds": 5.36,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.93,
      "end_seconds": 269.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 270.56,
      "end_seconds": 272.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.16,
      "end_seconds": 279.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 280.9,
      "end_seconds": 285.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "I had a triple bypass eight years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.13,
      "end_seconds": 306.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Let me get the readings out of the way."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.27,
      "end_seconds": 317.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.6,
      "end_seconds": 344.23,
      "duration_seconds": 9.63,
      "text": "Okay: heart rate 78, blood pressure 108 over 77, oxygen saturation is 97 percent, respiratory rate 17, temperature is 36.8 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 347.17,
      "end_seconds": 352.53,
      "duration_seconds": 5.36,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 353.46,
      "end_seconds": 356.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "I'll listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 365.97,
      "end_seconds": 371.28,
      "duration_seconds": 5.31,
      "text": "There's tenderness in the lower tummy on the left, and no guarding."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 373.36,
      "end_seconds": 374.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 379.77,
      "end_seconds": 382.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 398.45,
      "end_seconds": 406.66,
      "duration_seconds": 8.21,
      "text": "Let me repeat that back to make sure. You've had pain around your period, and no vaginal discharge or vomiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 407.53,
      "end_seconds": 409.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 421.02,
      "end_seconds": 424.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Any scans or blood work done already?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 426.18,
      "end_seconds": 433.59,
      "duration_seconds": 7.41,
      "text": "I did have a pelvic ultrasound done last year, but the paper's at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 435.66,
      "end_seconds": 462.24,
      "duration_seconds": 26.58,
      "text": "Let's get a swab test, for pelvic pain. I'm going to order a pregnancy test, for pelvic pain. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. A heat pad and some gentle movement help many people, and a pain diary helps me see a pattern. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 466.53,
      "end_seconds": 470.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 471.82,
      "end_seconds": 473.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
}